  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Starting at 1st level, so long as the dreamguard gets 8 hours of rest, every night they have a dream that gives them a powerful vision. This takes one of two forms, as decided by the GM:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>They will receive a glimpse that something that will happen in the next 24 hours. This bit of information amounts to a sentence or two of dialogue, a face, a name, etc. It’s often couched in a lot of metaphorical and dream-like imagery.</li>\n<li>They gain a view of a place far from where they are that is important to their current quest, goal, or mission (or at least something useful) as if they were using the scrying spell.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/dreamguard#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
